    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«に対して» can mark the recipient of an action or set two groups against each other.",
     "texto": [
      "Read the predicate: a verb like 答える favours \"to\" or \"toward\"; two parallel descriptions favour \"in contrast\". Don't force a single translation.",
      "しつもん に たいして、 たんとうしゃ が こたえました。 (The person in charge answered the question.)",
      "きぎょう は けいひ を へらした。 これ に たいして、 りようしゃ は ふべん だ と かんじた。 (The company reduced its expenses. In contrast, the users felt it was inconvenient.)"
     ],
